            "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 3584,
            "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 190
          },
          "content": "{\"answer\":\"按政策（POLICY-A-2026-10-v1）：常规退货需先经批准，批准后还要等待仓库确认收货；只有在模拟支付对账成功之后，才能说“模拟退款成功”。也就是说，仓库收货是必要环节，但收货本身不等于退款成功，最终以对账成功为准。资格通过也不代表已批准退款。\",\"needs_input\":false,\"citations\":[\"模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-REFUND-01\",\"模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-RETURN-01\"],\"facts\":[{\"kind\":\"POLICY\",\"resource_id\":\"POLICY-A-2026-10-v1\",\"field\":\"standard_return_window_seconds\",\"value\":604800},{\"kind\":\"POLICY\",\"resource_id\":\"POLICY-A-2026-10-v1\",\"field\":\"all_refunds_require_review\",\"value\":true},{\"kind\":\"POLICY\",\"resource_id\":\"POLICY-A-2026-10-v1\",\"field\":\"evaluated_at\",\"value\":\"2026-10-11T02:00:00Z\"}]}"
        }
