            "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 587
          },
          "content": "{\"answer\":\"按政策（POLICY-A-2026-10-v1）：常规退货需先获得批准，批准后还要等待仓库确认收货；只有模拟支付对账成功，才能报告模拟退款成功。也就是说，仓库收货是常规退货退款流程中的必要环节，收货并审核通过、对账成功后才会显示退款成功。资格通过不等于批准退款，退款也需审核。\",\"needs_input\":false,\"citations\":[\"模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-REFUND-01\",\"模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-RETURN-01\",\"模拟售后政策 POLICY-A-2026-10-v1 / A-RETURN-02\"],\"facts\":[{\"kind\":\"POLICY\",\"resource_id\":\"POLICY-A-2026-10-v1\",\"field\":\"standard_return_window_seconds\",\"value\":604800},{\"kind\":\"POLICY\",\"resource_id\":\"POLICY-A-2026-10-v1\",\"field\":\"all_refunds_require_review\",\"value\":true},{\"kind\":\"POLICY\",\"resource_id\":\"POLICY-A-2026-10-v1\",\"field\":\"evaluated_at\",\"value\":\"2026-10-11T02:00:00Z\"}]}"
